// Google-only "core" sitemap (/sitemap-core.xml).
//
// Google crawled only a handful of the ~1,660 pages and left the rest as
// "Discovered – currently not indexed", so this sitemap shows Google just the
// hub pages plus the number pages that have actually been rewritten (or get
// real traffic). It is submitted manually in Search Console and deliberately
// NOT listed in robots.txt — Naver and other bots keep using the full
// sitemap-index.xml generated by @astrojs/sitemap. Nothing here noindexes or
// removes a page; it only decides what goes into this one file.
//
// Number lists come from the work logs in docs/. Add new numbers here when a
// rewrite batch is completed.

